Package: ivcrtest
Type: Package
Title: Correlation-Restriction Test for Instrument Validity
Version: 0.2.1.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ratbek", "Dzhumashev", email= "ratbek.dzhumashev@monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ainura", "Tursunalieva", email = "ainura.tursunalieva@csiro.au", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2784-9031")),
    person("Xinyue", "Bei", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Union-bound routines adapted from the UnionBounds package; see inst/COPYRIGHTS"))
Description: Tests whether the orthogonality restriction on an instrument remains
    compatible with the data once the sign and magnitude of endogeneity are
    restricted. Inference uses the modified conditional union-bound interval of
    Bei (2024) <doi:10.2139/ssrn.5023605>, computed through the exact
    two-dimensional linear reparameterisation of the finite-grid map, with
    Imbens-Manski/Stoye and naive selected-endpoint intervals reported as
    diagnostics. The test is described in Dzhumashev and Tursunalieva (2026)
    <doi:10.1080/07474938.2026.2741548>.
URL: https://github.com/Ainura-tur/ivcrtest
